<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia pay-tv players agree to rationalise.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia pay-tv players agree to rationalise.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Telstra Corp said on Friday that owners of Australia's pay tv industry had agreed to a rationalisation involving its Foxtel partner News Corp Ltd and Kerry Packer's Publishing and Broadcasting Ltd.</p>
<p>PBL is a key financial backer of satellite-based pay television operator Australis Media Ltd.</p>
